flowchart TB
  A["Setup (once): set PIN, seed domains & sources, backfill 2 weeks"] --> B["Login: 6-digit PIN<br/>(5 wrong per IP -> 15 min lock, doubling)"]
  B --> C["Settings<br/>Domains 8-10 | Sources on/off, params, keys, test | Delivery | Security | Usage"]
  C --> D["Weekdays (automatic)<br/>ingest -> match -> score -> enrich"]
  D --> E["Monday 07:00 IST brief (~8.5 min)<br/>week line + Top 3 -> per domain S-C-I, HERO, 2 STANDARD, <=5 COMPACT<br/>rising lane, quiet domains, source health, coverage window"]
  E --> F["Read -> reading queue"]
  E --> G["Share with clients -> notable log<br/>+ note, client tag -> domain profile learns"]
  E --> H["Skip"]
  G --> L["Log: filter by client / domain / week -> CSV for the deck"]
  E --> M["Consulting moments (any day)"]
  M --> S["Search: / or Cmd-K, facets, presets<br/>'What's new in X since date'"]
  M --> Q["Ask agent"]
  Q --> Q1["Bet on X? -> Bet / Pilot / Watch / Avoid + evidence"]
  Q --> Q2["Use case backed? -> rung counts, results, gaps"]
  Q --> Q3["Where is domain heading? -> S-C-I, rising, signals"]
  Q --> Q4["Term -> explanation + recent papers"]
  Q --> Q5["Prep me for client -> talking points + her flags"]
  Q1 & Q2 & Q3 & Q4 & Q5 --> R["Cited, confidence-graded answer<br/>Copy as client note | Export .md | Save to log"]
  R --> L
  E -.-> X["Failure paths: source down -> footer | quiet domain -> nearest miss<br/>no papers -> no empty email | credits out -> deterministic text"]
